    "details": {
      "cr": 2.0,
      "type": {
        "value": "custom",
        "subtype": "",
        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Carvão Vivo. Sempre que Magby inspira ou expira, faíscas escapam de sua boca e de suas narinas. Um sangue semelhante a magma circula por todo o seu corpo, elevando sua temperatura a cerca de 600 °C.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Não Descoberto &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 75% M / 25% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Magby pode evoluir para Magmar no nível 10 ou superior quando sua Lealdade for +2 ou maior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Leer, Smog</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Ember</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Smokescreen</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Feint Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Fire Spin</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Flame Wheel</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Clear Smog</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Flame Burst, Scary Face</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Confuse Ray</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Fire Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Lava Plume</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Low Kick, Sunny Day</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Flamethrower</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Fire Blast</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acid Spray, Attract, Body Slam, Brick Break, Burning Jealousy, Confide, Confuse Ray, Covet, Curse, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dual Chop, Endure, Facade, Fire Blast, Fire Punch, Fire Spin, Flame Charge, Flamethrower, Flare Blitz, Fling, Focus Energy, Focus Punch, Frustration, Heat Wave, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Tail, Low Kick, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Overheat, Poison Jab, Power Swap, Protect, Psychic, Rest, Return, Rock Smash, Round, Scary Face, Screech, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Take Down, Temper Flare, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Punch, Toxic, Uproar, Will-O-Wisp</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Barrier, Belch, Belly Drum, Cross Chop, Dynamic Punch, Flare Blitz, Focus Energy, Focus Punch, Follow Me, Iron Tail, Karate Chop, Mach Punch, Mega Punch, Power Swap, Screech, Thunder Punch</p>",
